     "body": "<p>The description says: </p>\n\n<blockquote><p>Once the kernel-api no longer has a direct dependency on JCR,</p></blockquote>\n\n<p>Is this already the case? If not, I think there should be a blocker ticket associated to track this effort. </p>",
